{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18206220","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18206220","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:4:1820622001:0":{"text":"ママ！ボクを連れてきてくれた人たちだよ！","source_cn":"妈妈！是，刚刚的人！带皮普回家的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56E88DE7AE6F39E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1820622002:0":{"text":"え？人たち……？","source_cn":"人？刚刚的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE5BFFB52E3E6A93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1820622003:0":{"text":"ムン婆が、あなたたちを、動物に？ずいぶん、早いわね。","source_cn":"穆婆婆，让你们也变成了动物？这么快？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33C2F943C51304C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1820622004:0":{"text":"やはり、あの婆さんの仕業なのか。一体何をされたんだ！？","source_cn":"你们果然是被穆婆婆变成这样的。她对你们做了什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8E80045DCC8FDC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1820622004":{"text":"やはり、あの婆さんの仕業なのか。一体何をされたんだ！？","source_cn":"你们果然是被穆婆婆变成这样的。她对你们做了什么？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8E80045DCC8FDC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1820622005:0":{"text":"ムン婆が、動物にしてくれたの。こんな風にね。","source_cn":"穆婆婆帮助我们，变成动物。像我这样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB67043156488AC0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1820622006:0":{"text":"昔は、グレイヴボーンだった。夕染村の、グレイヴボーン。でも、記憶が、曖昧に……","source_cn":"很久以前，是亡灵，夕染村的亡灵。但是，记忆变模糊了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x370028DA2BA8B03F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1820622007:0":{"text":"街の人たちは、腕や、足、肋骨を交換。でも、村には、ないから。","source_cn":"城里人说要换手臂，换腿，换肋骨。可是没有那些东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF52FB80C6C8B3BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1820622008:0":{"text":"……腕を交換？","source_cn":"……换手臂？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07651577B684D136","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1820622009:0":{"text":"記憶や意識がすり減って、正気を失うのを防ぐため、グレイヴボーンは体のパーツを交換する必要があることをセインに説明した。","source_cn":"你为瑟恩简单讲述了亡灵需要更换肢体，防止记忆和意识磨损...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9E5FF6524C7E97E3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"記憶や意識がすり減って、正気を失うのを防ぐため、グレイヴボーンは体のパーツを交換する必要があることをセインに説明した。","female":"記憶や意識がすり減って、正気を失うのを防ぐため、グレイヴボーンは体のパーツを交換する必要があることをセインに説明した。","variant_male_record_index":"245407","variant_female_record_index":"245408","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1820622010:1":{"text":"セインは黙り込み、しばらくしてから深く、ゆっくりと息を吸い込んだ。","source_cn":"瑟恩沉默着，很久很久才深深地、缓慢地吸了一口气。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3165D130BEE33BA0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"セインは黙り込み、しばらくしてから深く、ゆっくりと息を吸い込んだ。","female":"セインは黙り込み、しばらくしてから深く、ゆっくりと息を吸い込んだ。","variant_male_record_index":"245409","variant_female_record_index":"245410","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1820622011:0":{"text":"なるほど、重武器がバンティス兵に有効なのも道理だな。奴らの脆い体は、鎧を身につけていても攻撃に耐えきれない。","source_cn":"难怪重型武器能够轻易击杀班题斯士兵。他们的身体太过脆弱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3825FCCDB9423D37","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1820622012:0":{"text":"つまり、お前たちはもともと夕染村の村人だったが、交換できるパーツがなかったため、婆さんに動物の姿に変えてもらったのだな。","source_cn":"所以，你们曾经是夕染村的村民。但因为没有可以用于更换的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE81FC010FDA125CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1820622013:0":{"text":"「変えた」は、少し違う。でも、そんな感じ。","source_cn":"不是，变成。但是，差不多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF12ACFDAE2E0A428","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1820622014:0":{"text":"もとの体は、腐った。魂は、残っている。動物は、新しい体。","source_cn":"原本的身体腐烂了，灵魂，还在。动物是新的身体。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EBEB97B41BB900B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1820622014":{"text":"もとの体は、腐った。魂は、残っている。動物は、新しい体。","source_cn":"原本的身体腐烂了，灵魂，还在。动物是新的身体。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EBEB97B41BB900B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1820622015:0":{"text":"魂の移転……そんな、言葉、だった気がする。","source_cn":"灵魂转移……好像，是这个词。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2101F9CE693ED989","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1820622016:0":{"text":"ムン婆、優しい。私たちが苦しむのを、見たくなくて。動物の体、あまり考えない。たくさん、忘れた。","source_cn":"穆婆婆，不希望我们痛苦。动物的身体，思考得很少，忘记了很多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AD5C6167F33B6C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1820622017:0":{"text":"優しいだと？どうやら、婆さんの性格も忘れたようだな。","source_cn":"或许你也忘记了她的为人。她远没有你说的那么友善。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03BDDB9C2219BC68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1820622018:0":{"text":"あなたは、今しか知らないから。昔は、そうじゃなかった。","source_cn":"你只看到现在。以前，她不是这样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87DA01840930CC20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1820622019:0":{"text":"もっと、昔。彼女は、魔法が使えなかった。子どもの面倒を見るだけ。私たちのために、魔法を学んだの。","source_cn":"很久以前，她不会魔法，只会照顾孩子。为了我们，她才学习魔法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91DD15641EF2ADD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1820622020:0":{"text":"彼女は、体を変えた。腕、足……たくさん。性格も、変わった。","source_cn":"她换过身体。手臂、腿……很多。性格就变了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9D1EF566290E08C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:26:1820622020":{"text":"彼女は、体を変えた。腕、足……たくさん。性格も、変わった。","source_cn":"她换过身体。手臂、腿……很多。性格就变了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9D1EF566290E08C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1820622021:0":{"text":"その言葉、意味は分からないけど、たぶんそう。","source_cn":"不知道那个词的意思。也许是吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F329896DFAA582A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1820622022:1":{"text":"ムンばあちゃんはいい人だよ！いつもあたまをなでてくれるんだ！ゴロゴロ～","source_cn":"穆婆婆是好人！经常帮皮普挠头！呼噜噜~","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x895AA1D55AD48A4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1820622023:0":{"text":"……この子の振る舞いは、もはや動物と変わらないな。","source_cn":"……皮普的行为已经和动物没什么区别了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x893AB208108CA69E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1820622024:0":{"text":"私たちも、同じよ。ヒップは体が小さい分、もっとひどいけど。","source_cn":"动物行为，大家都有。只不过，皮普体型小，更严重。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x077E5C1E8206B9C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1820622025:0":{"text":"でも、この子が楽しくて、悩みもないなら。それで十分よ。","source_cn":"但是，他很开心，没有忧愁。足够了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDF722ECF0CF615B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1820622026:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1820622027:1":{"text":"ガオオォー！","source_cn":"吼喔——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B2E9803DE56E878","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:26:0:1":{"text":"つまり、記憶が混濁したと……？","source_cn":"你是说她出现了记忆混淆？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD98022A01A08B3F7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys